{"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/write(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/readLine(prompt:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/showStatus(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/updateCompletions(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/finish(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Input","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/StatusLine","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameStatus","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/CompletionCandidates","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/CompletionCandidates\/Context-swift.enum","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TerminalIOHandler","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ConsoleIOHandler","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScriptedIOHandler","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScriptedIOHandler\/transcript"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StatusFooter"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"syntax":null,"code":["[status] room=Front Hall | moves=12 | score=0 | turn=cost | time=5:46 pm"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A transcript is prose, and prose does not say where you are standing or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what the last command cost. A tester reading one back has to reconstruct"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"both, and the reconstruction is where the mistakes come from: counting","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"commands as turns is wrong the moment one of them fails to parse or turns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out to be a meta verb, and “which room was that?” is a scroll upwards."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"moves="},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"turn="},{"type":"text","text":" answer the first; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"room="},{"type":"text","text":" answers the second."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A contributed field like ","type":"text"},{"code":"time=","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" answers a third — ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"when","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" — and is sampled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at the turn’s close rather than after its counter advanced, so that it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names the minute the turn’s own words were written in. See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"statusFields"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Off unless asked for. ","type":"text"},{"code":"GNUSTO_STATUS","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is read by ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameMain","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"composition root — and the value handed to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/REPL\/init(world:io:transcriptURL:status:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The test suite constructs its REPLs without the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"argument, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"GNUSTO_STATUS=1 swift test","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" changes nothing: the footer is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"opt-in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"by construction","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" rather than by an environment variable happening","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to be unset.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Modelled on "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SeedRequest"},{"type":"text","text":": a value type that reads one variable, hands"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"back what it found, and complains about a value it could not read instead"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of quietly doing something else."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The one-line out-of-fiction note a play-test session can have appended to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every turn:","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/StatusFooter\/init(environment:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/StatusFooter\/complaint","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/StatusFooter\/inForce"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/statusfooter"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/StatusFooter"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StatusFooter","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StatusFooter","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","title":"StatusFooter","externalID":"s